aad:GroundwaterPhysicochemicalParameter rdfs:subClassOf aad:MeasurementProperty .
aad:HydrogeochemicalCharacterization rdfs:subClassOf aad:InvestigationProcess .
aad:HydrogeochemicalData rdfs:subClassOf aad:Dataset .
aad:GroundwaterProtection rdfs:subClassOf aad:ManagementMeasure .
aad:GroundwaterVulnerability rdfs:subClassOf aad:Quality .

